<BRK/>
<ITM><SUB>Lighting</SUB> fixtures</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM><SUB>Exhaust fans</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM><SUB>Door assemblies</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<LST><SUB>SD-06 Test Reports</SUB></LST><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  When specifying nonlatching doors, delete door static load and sag tests and cycle test for door latches.  
Retain cycle test for door hinges.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<ITM>Door <SUB>static load test</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>Door <SUB>sag test</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>Swinging door <SUB>closure test</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>EMI factory tests for <SUB>line filters</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
